      "summary": "针对标准库 I/O 耗时大及算法模板碎片化痛点，研发集纳秒级极速输入输出流引擎、泛化模板高级树结构与网络流、计算几何函数于一体的现代 C++ 算法框架。",
      "hasCode": true,
      "codeArchiveId": "2023-gushun-cactus",
      "details": {
        "skills": "C++ 模板元编程、Concept 约束、大规模工程 CMake 构建、单元测试覆盖率审计、开源协作 Git 流",
        "difficulties": "高维泛型抽象下的编译期类型安全与运行时极限性能优化，跨平台 STL 兼容性",
        "innovations": "脱离单次刷题的思维局限，以现代工业级软件工程标准构建高质量公共算法底座，获评审团一致推举为凌绝望岳奖标杆。",
        "fullReportHtml": "<div class=\"space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 shadow-xs\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-200\">C++20 泛型模板元编程</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-200\">极致 I/O 缓冲引擎</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200\">高级数据结构与图论封装</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">项目定位与设计哲学</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 mb-4\">在信息学奥林匹克竞赛与高性能系统工程中，标准库 <code>cin/cout</code> 及频繁的动态内存申请常成为程序常数耗时瓶颈。顾顺与吴泽宇同学采用“在保证可控约束下适度放宽安全边界以换取极限运行速度”的底层优化哲学，从零构建了头文件库 <code>cactus.h</code>，涵盖极速输入输出指针、计算几何向量工具与泛化树结构体系。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 shadow-xs\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-600\"></span>\n      Cactus 架构四大技术支柱\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs\">\n      <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n        <div class=\"text-sky-700 font-bold mb-1\">1. 极速 I/O 流引擎 (io_assist)</div>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600\">基于预分配超大输入缓冲区与指针跳跃，跳过标准流层层虚函数开销，直接对无符号/有符号大整数进行移位累加，吞吐较 <code>scanf</code> 提速 5～10 倍。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n        <div class=\"text-indigo-700 font-bold mb-1\">2. 泛型平衡树与分块算法</div>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600\">以统一模板参数无缝封装 Splay、FHQ-Treap、分块动态树等，解耦节点分裂、合并与惰性标记下传，彻底告别赛场重复造轮子。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n        <div class=\"text-purple-700 font-bold mb-1\">3. 计算几何与复数代数库</div>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600\">定义高精度二维/三维向量运算、点积叉积几何意义、线段交点判断、凸包与旋转卡壳最小外接矩形求解套件。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n        <div class=\"text-emerald-700 font-bold mb-1\">4. 图论流网络优化 (Dinic / ISAP)</div>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600\">集成高效链式前向星与当前弧优化，提供开箱即用的最大流、费用流与二分图匹配统一接口。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 shadow-xs\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-600\"></span>\n      核心头文件类声明节选 (cactus.h)\n    </h3>\n    <pre class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded-xl overflow-x-auto border border-slate-800 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><code>class io_assist;\ntemplate &lt;typename cactus = int&gt; class io_pointer_i;\ntemplate &lt;typename cactus = int&gt; class io_pointer_o;\n\ntemplate &lt;typename cactus = int, int MaxSize = MAXN&gt; class array_c;\ntemplate &lt;typename cactus = int&gt; class min_mono_queue;\ntemplate &lt;typename cactus = int&gt; class max_mono_queue;\n\nclass union_set;\ntemplate &lt;typename cactus = int&gt; class tree_array;\ntemplate &lt;typename cactus = int&gt; class segment_tree;\ntemplate &lt;typename cactus = int&gt; class splay_tree;\ntemplate &lt;typename cactus = int&gt; class dinic_network_flow;</code></pre>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
